                        <tr><td><code>tags</code></td><td>Breadcrumb (first tag) and the tag pills in the post footer</td></tr>
                        <tr><td><code>seo.title</code> / <code>seo.description</code></td><td>Title tag, meta description, Open Graph</td></tr>
